N5008 [temp.variadic]/5,7: a call-argument pack expansion referencing a
TYPE pack and a NON-TYPE index pack in lockstep, mu<B>(get<I>(t))..., must
substitute the k-th element of BOTH packs per expansion element (the _Bind::
__call shape); the index pack was stamped with its first element.
